a:54:{s:4:"body";a:3:{s:5:"value";s:1078:"<p>The goal of this module is to make it possible to automatically save a draft of a webform whenever a jQuery change event is detected on an input or select elements on the form. This is done by creating 2 REST endpoints one for submitting the form, and another for patching (aka updating) a submission in progress. The module uses jQuery to detect the load and change events and fire AJAX calls to each of these endpoints appropriately.</p>
<p>This module requires the REST module and webform. Once enabled you will need to set up the appropriate "RESTful Web Services" permissions for each of the Autosave endpoints ("Access GET on Webform Autosave Submission resource", "Access PATCH on Webform Autosave Submission resource", and "Access POST on Webform Autosave Submit resource") on your site's /admin/people/permissions page.</p>
<p>Webform autosave includes a feature that allows you to add an Optimistic Locking strategy to a webform. This prevents users from overwriting each other's changes to a webform if they are editing the webform submission at the same time.</p>";s:7:"summary";s:195:"The goal of this module is to make it possible to automatically save a draft of a webform whenever a jQuery change event is detected on an input or select elements on the form. This is done by…";s:6:"format";s:1:"1";}s:22:"taxonomy_vocabulary_44";a:1:{s:2:"id";s:5:"19370";}s:22:"taxonomy_vocabulary_46";a:1:{s:2:"id";s:4:"9988";}s:21:"taxonomy_vocabulary_3";a:3:{i:0;a:1:{s:2:"id";s:2:"57";}i:1;a:1:{s:2:"id";s:3:"101";}i:2;a:1:{s:2:"id";s:2:"75";}}s:6:"upload";a:0:{}s:18:"field_project_type";s:4:"full";s:26:"field_project_machine_name";s:15:"webformautosave";s:29:"field_project_has_issue_queue";b:1;s:24:"field_project_components";a:4:{i:0;s:4:"Code";i:1;s:13:"Documentation";i:2;s:13:"Miscellaneous";i:3;s:14:"User interface";}s:31:"field_project_default_component";N;s:30:"field_project_issue_guidelines";a:0:{}s:26:"field_project_has_releases";b:1;s:28:"field_release_version_format";N;s:22:"field_project_homepage";a:0:{}s:23:"field_project_changelog";a:0:{}s:18:"field_project_demo";a:0:{}s:27:"field_project_documentation";a:0:{}s:25:"field_project_screenshots";a:0:{}s:21:"field_project_license";a:3:{s:3:"url";s:53:"http://www.gnu.org/licenses/old-licenses/gpl-2.0.html";s:10:"attributes";a:0:{}s:11:"display_url";N;}s:20:"field_project_images";a:0:{}s:32:"field_project_issue_version_opts";a:2:{i:0;s:6:"static";i:1;s:7:"dynamic";}s:32:"field_security_advisory_coverage";s:7:"covered";s:23:"field_project_ecosystem";a:1:{i:0;a:3:{s:3:"uri";s:39:"https://www.drupal.org/api-d7/node/7404";s:2:"id";s:4:"7404";s:8:"resource";s:4:"node";}}s:29:"field_next_major_version_info";a:0:{}s:17:"field_replaced_by";a:0:{}s:28:"field_issue_summary_template";a:0:{}s:3:"nid";s:7:"3100720";s:3:"vid";s:8:"12854146";s:6:"is_new";b:0;s:4: