a:54:{s:22:"taxonomy_vocabulary_44";a:1:{s:2:"id";s:5:"13028";}s:22:"taxonomy_vocabulary_46";a:1:{s:2:"id";s:4:"9988";}s:21:"taxonomy_vocabulary_3";a:2:{i:0;a:1:{s:2:"id";s:2:"69";}i:1;a:1:{s:2:"id";s:2:"74";}}s:6:"upload";a:0:{}s:4:"body";a:3:{s:5:"value";s:1242:"<p>Leaks and hacks we’ve read about in recent years make it clear that passwords alone don't provide enough security to protect your online accounts. Two-factor authentication (2FA or MFA, for multifactor authentication) adds another layer of protection. Authenticator apps, such as Twilio's Authy, Google Authenticator, or Microsoft Authenticator, enable one of the more-secure forms of 2FA. Using one of these apps can even help protect you against stealthy attacks like stalkerware.</p>
<p>This module when enabled provides the security option to users to setup 2FA via Authenticator apps. The module relies on <a href="https://github.com/antonioribeiro/google2fa-qrcode" rel="nofollow"> Google2FA QRCode</a> library. Use composer to install the module and the library will automatically install as required dependency. For <strong>Drupal 7</strong>, the library is part of the module so no need to worry about that for <strong>Drupal 7</strong>.</p>
<p>Tested and works great with popular and trusted authenticator apps like Google Authenticator, <a href="https://www.microsoft.com/en-us/security/mobile-authenticator-app" rel="nofollow">Microsoft Authenticator</a> &amp; <a href="https://authy.com" rel="nofollow">Twilio Authy</a>.</p>";s:7:"summary";s:194:"Leaks and hacks we’ve read about in recent years make it clear that passwords alone don't provide enough security to protect your online accounts. Two-factor authentication (2FA or MFA, for…";s:6:"format";s:1:"1";}s:18:"field_project_type";s:4:"full";s:26:"field_project_machine_name";s:6:"alogin";s:29:"field_project_has_issue_queue";b:1;s:24:"field_project_components";a:4:{i:0;s:4:"Code";i:1;s:13:"Documentation";i:2;s:13:"Miscellaneous";i:3;s:14:"User interface";}s:31:"field_project_default_component";N;s:30:"field_project_issue_guidelines";a:0:{}s:26:"field_project_has_releases";b:1;s:28:"field_release_version_format";N;s:22:"field_project_homepage";a:0:{}s:23:"field_project_changelog";a:0:{}s:18:"field_project_demo";a:0:{}s:27:"field_project_documentation";a:0:{}s:25:"field_project_screenshots";a:0:{}s:21:"field_project_license";a:3:{s:3:"url";s:53:"http://www.gnu.org/licenses/old-licenses/gpl-2.0.html";s:10:"attributes";a:0:{}s:11:"display_url";N;}s:20:"field_project_images";a:1:{i:0;a:2:{s:4:"file";a:3:{s:3:"uri";s:42:"https://www.drupal.org/api-d7/file/6508373";s:2:"id";s:7:"6508373";s:8:"resource";s:4:"file";}s:3:"alt";s:20:"Guy scanning QR code";}}s:32:"field_project_issue_version_opts";a:2:{i:0;s:6:"static";i:1;s:7:"dynamic";}s:32:"field_security_advisory_coverage";s:7:"covered";s:23:"field_project_ecosystem";a:0:{}s:29:"field_next_major_version_info";a:0:{}s:17:"field_replaced_by";a:0:{}s:28:"field_issue_summary_template";a:0:{}s:3:"nid";s:7:"3239065";s:3:"vid";s:8:"12813414";s:6:"is_new";b:0;s:4:"type";s:14:"project_module";s:5:"title";s:19:"Authenticator Login";s:8:"language";s:2:"en";s:8:"edit_url";s:40:"https://www.drupal.org/node/3239065/edit";s:6:"