a:53:{s:22:"taxonomy_vocabulary_44";a:1:{s:2:"id";s:4:"9990";}s:22:"taxonomy_vocabulary_46";a:1:{s:2:"id";s:4:"9988";}s:21:"taxonomy_vocabulary_3";a:5:{i:0;a:1:{s:2:"id";s:2:"53";}i:1;a:1:{s:2:"id";s:2:"57";}i:2;a:1:{s:2:"id";s:2:"59";}i:3;a:1:{s:2:"id";s:5:"20224";}i:4;a:1:{s:2:"id";s:2:"75";}}s:6:"upload";a:0:{}s:4:"body";a:3:{s:5:"value";s:703:"<p>This module serves as the superstructure for <a href="https://drupal.org/project/formfactorykits" rel="nofollow">formfactorykits</a> module.</p>
<p>It provides a simple service which can load an existing <code class="language-php">$form</code> array, append FormFactoryKit objects &amp; return a modified <code class="language-php">$form</code> array.</p>
<pre class="codeblock"><code class="language-php">public function buildForm(array $form, FormStateInterface $form_state) {
  $factory = $this-&gt;formFactoryService-&gt;load($form);
  $k = $this-&gt;formFactoryKitsService;

  $factory-&gt;append($k-&gt;text())
    -&gt;append($k-&gt;submit());

  return $factory-&gt;getForm();
}
</code></pre>";s:7:"summary";s:200:"This module serves as the superstructure for formfactorykits module.
