a:53:{s:22:"taxonomy_vocabulary_44";a:1:{s:2:"id";s:5:"13028";}s:22:"taxonomy_vocabulary_46";a:1:{s:2:"id";s:4:"9988";}s:21:"taxonomy_vocabulary_3";a:1:{i:0;a:1:{s:2:"id";s:2:"57";}}s:6:"upload";a:0:{}s:4:"body";a:3:{s:5:"value";s:690:"<p>This module provides a ready-to-use set of configuration for displaying Person nodes on your website, for example in a staff directory, faculty list, or list of physicians. The Auto Entity Label module is leveraged so editors only need to provide first and last names, and will be combined into a title for the node.</p>
<p>Also included is a view to list people alphabetically by last name, in either a full list (ideal for a small organization or to show grouped, for example by department) or in a glossary style, displaying all the people whose last names begin with a single letter.</p>
