<p>In your consumer (JS application) instead of making requests to:</p>
<p><code class="language-php">https://api.example.org/v1/the-resource/123?setting[foo]=bar&amp;lorem=10</code></p>
<p>Make them against:</p>
<p><code class="language-php">https://your-drupal-install.com/api-proxy/api-slug?_api_proxy_uri=the-resource%2F123%3Fsetting%5Bfoo%5D%3Dbar%26lorem%3D10</code></p>
