a:54:{s:4:"body";a:3:{s:5:"value";s:918:"<p>Adds in the Panel Button plugin for CKEditor.</p>
<p>This is required by plugins that need panel button to work, like <a href="https://www.drupal.org/project/colorbutton" rel="nofollow">Color Button</a>.</p>
<p>Other plugins can leverage panel button by adding this in their plugin definition:</p>
<pre class="codeblock"><code class="language-php">class YourButtonPlugin extends CKEditorPluginBase implements CKEditorPluginConfigurableInterface {
  /**
   * {@inheritdoc}
   */
  public function getDependencies(Editor $editor) {
    return ['panelbutton'];
  }

  // more code...
</code></pre><h3>Installation</h3>
<ol>
<li>Download the plugin from <a href="http://ckeditor.com/addon/panelbutton" rel="nofollow">http://ckeditor.com/addon/panelbutton</a> at least version 4.5.6.</li>
<li>Place the plugin in the root libraries folder (/libraries).</li>
<li>Enable Panel Button module in the Drupal admin.</li>
