a:53:{s:4:"body";a:3:{s:5:"value";s:713:"<p>Integration of Drupal with <a href="https://opentelemetry.io/" rel="nofollow">OpenTelemetry</a> <a href="https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-php/" rel="nofollow">OpenTelemetry php library</a>.</p>
<h2>Usage example in custom code:</h2>
<pre class="codeblock"><code class="language-php">$tracer = \Drupal::service('opentelemetry')-&gt;createTracer();
$spanRoot = $tracer-&gt;startAndActivateSpan('Main span');
sleep(1);
for($i = 1; $i &lt;= 5; $i++) {
  $span = $tracer-&gt;startAndActivateSpan('Inner span ' . $i);
  \usleep(rand(300,3000));
  $span-&gt;end();
}
$spanRoot-&gt;end();
\Drupal::messenger()-&gt;addMessage('Main span id: ' . $spanRoot-&gt;getContext()-&gt;getTraceId());
</code></pre>";s:7:"summary";s:188:"Integration of Drupal with OpenTelemetry OpenTelemetry php library.
