a:54:{s:4:"body";a:3:{s:5:"value";s:620:"<p>Cha-ching is a donation register.  It records instant payment notification (IPN) data received from PayPal, and makes the metadata (payment amount and date) available via JSON and RSS feeds for display and graphing purposes.</p>
