a:54:{s:4:"body";a:3:{s:5:"value";s:673:"<p>This module basically has the same idea as <a href="media_bulk_upload" rel="nofollow">https://www.drupal.org/project/media_bulk_upload</a>, however it does not use DropzoneJS for the file upload and instead relies on the Drupal's file upload mechanism and utilizes the Media Library.</p>
<p>After installing the module you will have to configure the permissions which user roles should be able to utilize the bulk upload and for which media types.</p>
